OL,3,AOasis tease tour announcement with
OL,4,Adrone display
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe band, who reunited for the first
OL,7,Ftime since splitting in 2009 for the
OL,8,Fsuccessful Live '25 tour last year,
OL,9,Fhave been dropping hints about tour
OL,10,Fvenues on social media recently.
